      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Arkansas Southern Railway arrived in 1898, sparking a boom that led to the town’s founding.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dubach%2C_Louisiana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dubach earned the title “The Dog Trot Capital of the World” from the Louisiana Legislature in 1990.",
